</figure><div class="tag">Canada · Electric</div><h3><a href="/global/can-am-pulse-origin-electric-motorcycles.html">Can-Am Pulse and Origin: city or dual-sport?</a></h3><p>Two different approaches to electric motorcycling, and why charging, conditions and riding purpose matter.</p>
