('/global/bajaj-pulsar-indian-motorcycle-evolution.html','Bajaj Pulsar: the performance commuter','A look at how India''s long-running Pulsar family balanced sporty character with practical everyday riding.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile" data-manufacturer="Bajaj" data-type="roadsters"><figure class="featured-photo">
