('/global/bimota-tesi-h2-blimey-look-at-that.html','Bimota Tesi H2 and its unusual front end','Why does the Bimota Tesi H2 have such a strange-looking front end? The engineering is even more interesting than the styling.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile illustrated-lead" id="global-story-blimey-look-at-that" data-manufacturer="Bimota" data-type="sports"><figure class="section-photo"><img src="/assets/global/bimota-tesi-h2-2020.webp" width="1041" height="900" alt="Bimota Tesi H2 on display with its front swingarm visible" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>Bimota Tesi H2 (2020) · Photo courtesy of <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bimota_Tesi_H2_(2020).jpg">Matthb1395</a> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a> · Resized and cropped</figcaption></figure><div class="tag">Italy · Cutting-edge chassis design</div><h3>Bimota Tesi H2 and its unusual front end</h3><p>Why does the Bimota Tesi H2 have such a strange-looking front end? The engineering is even more interesting than the styling.</p><a href="/global/bimota-tesi-h2-blimey-look-at-that.html">Explore the Tesi H2 design →</a><p><a href="/motorcycle-brand.html?make=Bimota">View Bimota motorcycles →</a></p></article>','published','c6dabdfca1af363b3540a0d50f4783564d2c4dd4c814cb323d747bf670987e2b'),
('/global/suzuki-rm250-motocross-suspension-history.html','Suzuki RM250: motocross development','Follow the changes in the Suzuki RM250''s engine, cooling and suspension through documented factory-archive model years.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile illustrated-lead" data-country="Japan" data-manufacturer="Suzuki" data-type="off-road"><figure class="section-photo"><img src="/assets/global/suzuki-rm250-2004.webp" width="1040" height="693" alt="Yellow Suzuki RM250 motocross motorcycle parked on dirt" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><figcaption>2004 Suzuki RM250 · Photo courtesy of <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kaique199.jpg">Kaique 199</a> · <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a> · Resized and cropped</figcaption></figure><div class="tag">Suzuki · Motocross · Generations</div><h3>Suzuki RM250: motocross development</h3><p>Follow the changes in the Suzuki RM250''s engine, cooling and suspension through documented factory-archive model years.</p><a href="/global/suzuki-rm250-motocross-suspension-history.html">Read the Suzuki RM250 story →</a><p><a href="/motorcycle-model-guide.html?make=Suzuki&amp;model=RM250">Explore the exact Suzuki model →</a></p></article>','published','532fdf4775fdfaa02f8f954010f92db997cd4461a0ed51a71f925bc4cf1d12d6'),
