('/global/ducati-diavel-v4-i-want-one.html','Ducati Diavel V4','The Ducati Diavel V4 combines muscle-bike presence with modern V4 engineering. Let''s take a look at what makes it so distinctive.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile" id="global-story-i-want-one" data-manufacturer="Ducati" data-type="cruisers"><div class="tag">Italy · Motorcycle desire</div><h3>Ducati Diavel V4</h3><p>The Ducati Diavel V4 combines muscle-bike presence with modern V4 engineering. Let''s take a look at what makes it so distinctive.</p><a href="/global/ducati-diavel-v4-i-want-one.html">See the Diavel story →</a></article>','published','4d58928a0e8ebebaef413791754a1f0c8b0438e6f148bebf1ccaff3fd5af09b7'),
('/global/honda-nm4-vultus-did-you-know.html','Honda NM4 Vultus','Honda once made a motorcycle that looked like it had arrived from a science-fiction film. Meet the NM4 Vultus.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile" id="global-story-did-you-know" data-manufacturer="Honda" data-type="scooters"><div class="tag">Japan · Unexpected design</div><h3>Honda NM4 Vultus</h3><p>Honda once made a motorcycle that looked like it had arrived from a science-fiction film. Meet the NM4 Vultus.</p><a href="/global/honda-nm4-vultus-did-you-know.html">Read about the Honda NM4 Vultus →</a></article>','published','168f58c94835a1c56c7b805a0957f85e6d5f90d1eff3f14f3189b8117c2f803b'),
('/global/honda-gold-wing-dct-grand-touring.html','Honda Gold Wing: DCT for long-distance riding','How a seven-speed dual-clutch transmission fits the Gold Wing''s emphasis on touring comfort and smooth control.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile" data-manufacturer="Honda" data-type="touring"><div class="tag">Japan · Touring</div><h3>Honda Gold Wing: DCT for long-distance riding</h3><p>How a seven-speed dual-clutch transmission fits the Gold Wing''s emphasis on touring comfort and smooth control.</p><a href="/global/honda-gold-wing-dct-grand-touring.html">Read about the Gold Wing’s DCT →</a><p class="related-link"><a href="/models/honda/gold-wing-gl1800.html">Gold Wing GL1800 model guide →</a></p></article>','published','fd4c311aa3accdf857523a827a22516025a8dfb914436b35d9e978b11ea05f96'),
('/global/indian-scout-chief-and-springfield-history.html','Scout, Chief and the Springfield Years','The original factory, legendary motorcycles and the differences between historic generations.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile" data-country="United States" data-manufacturer="Indian Motorcycle" data-type="heritage"><div class="tag">1901–1953 · Indian heritage</div><h3>Scout, Chief and the Springfield Years</h3><p>The original factory, legendary motorcycles and the differences between historic generations.</p><a href="/global/indian-scout-chief-and-springfield-history.html">Read the history of the Scout and Chief →</a></article>','published','b1ee2208b50abdd7ede9454763f2cd35564fe96e9665c8abe71142d206d63fb0'),
('/global/yamaha-yz250-1974-monocross-history.html','Yamaha YZ250: the Monocross milestone','What made the 1974 YZ250M distinctive? The original Yamaha archive documents its Monocross rear suspension and two-stroke engine.','anybike-global.html','<article class="tile" data-country="Japan" data-manufacturer="Yamaha" data-type="off-road"><div class="tag">Yamaha · 1974 · Suspension history</div><h3>Yamaha YZ250: the Monocross milestone</h3><p>What made the 1974 YZ250M distinctive? The original Yamaha archive documents its Monocross rear suspension and two-stroke engine.</p><a href="/global/yamaha-yz250-1974-monocross-history.html">Read the 1974 Yamaha story →</a><p><a href="/motorcycle-model-guide.html?make=Yamaha&amp;model=YZ250">Explore Yamaha YZ250 model research →</a></p></article>','published','2bb4f3c360ee9ab690d47d4124e22ecad0e18e5a2f4e2c6cc1a5f0eb1fc302cf') on conflict (story_url) do nothing;
